CuTe backend attribution
========================

The CuTe k-means kernels were developed in DongyunZou/flash-kmeans-cute as a
collaboration between Dongyun Zou and Ligeng Zhu, then adapted to the
flash-kmeans backend API.

This work was produced end to end by Kernel Design Agents (KDA). Thanks to the
KDA team.

cache_utils.py contains code adapted from Dao-AILab/flash-attention's CuTe JIT
cache. That code is distributed under the adjacent LICENSE-BSD-3-Clause.
